Electronics Engineering
=======================

This repository provides resources, notes, and practical examples related to Electronics Engineering. Electronics Engineering is the branch of engineering that deals with the design, analysis, and application of circuits, devices, and systems that use electricity, electronics, and electromagnetism. It covers topics ranging from basic circuit theory and semiconductor devices to embedded systems, signal processing, and communications.

Topics Covered
--------------

- Circuit analysis and passive components (resistors, capacitors, inductors)
- Semiconductor devices (diodes, BJTs, MOSFETs)
- Operational amplifiers and analog signal conditioning
- Digital electronics and logic design
- Microcontroller programming and interfacing
- Power electronics and regulation
- Communication fundamentals and signal processing
